WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is always a delight
to have you here.

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
The first thing I have to
ask you about --

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:05.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
And backstage, it was a little
jarring for me, as well.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is the first time
a lot of people

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
have seen you
with hair like this.

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:12.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
Yeah, so, about that, right?

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:12.612 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:15.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
-For all the machismo and
bravado that oozes

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.651 line:92%
out of the WWE and its audience,

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:22.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
they're so shaken by
a damn haircut.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:23.223 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:25.492 size:88% position:44%
-Guys, I've been rockin'
an $8 fade for 20 years,

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:27.193 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I finally decided
to grow it out.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:27.694 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:29.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm sorry to make
you uncomfortable.

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:30.230 line:92%
I am. I'm sorry. I apologize.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.132
-Well, I think they're
probably uncomfortable --

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:34.134 line:92%
It's such a corporate haircut.

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:37.370
Like, none of us could have
guessed what it would look like.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm in a damn
three-piece suit, man.

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:40.306 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah!

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:42.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It kind of --
It's the whole Clark Kent.

00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:43.243 line:92%
I mean, this is the thing.

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:46.746 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Your new wrestling name
should be "The CFO."

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:51.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah, there you go.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.320
-The finishing maneuver to be
"think outside of the box"?

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.188 line:92%
-Yeah, think outside of the box.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:56.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then you just toss them
out of the ring.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:01.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, man.
Well, that's 2019 for me.

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:03.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There you go.
-Right on.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.264 line:92%
-So, this is a lot of fun.

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:06.433
This is sort of an origin story
for the Transformers.

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:08.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
It takes place in 1987.
-Yeah.

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:12.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Where were you in 1987?
-So, I was -- Man, I was 10.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:12.739 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:15.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And '87 was a tough year...
-Yeah.

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:16.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...growing up in New England.
-Yeah.

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:18.912 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Patriots just got their
ass kicked in the Super Bowl.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.213 line:92%
-That's right. Not even close.

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:23.716
-Yeah, I don't know if anyone
remembers the 1986 World Series,

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.452
but that was a tough time
for the Boston Red Sox.

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:26.119 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light applause ]

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:27.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't, don't --
Are you a Mets fan?

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:31.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did a Mets fan sneak in here?
Tore my heart out!

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:35.195
-That was the worst for me ever,
the '86 World Series.

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:37.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because you're a Red Sox fan.
-Yeah, I'm a Red Sox fan.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have since denounced
my fandom.

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:40.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
I am a gypsy. I'm a gypsy fan.
-You are a gypsy fan.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, I go with
the winning teams.

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:46.506 align:start size:94% position:6%
-See, I hung on until 2004,
and that was my sweet release.

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:50.176
And now I just care less,
because it let me free.

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:53.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes. Yes, but '86 was tough.
-'86 was tough.

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:54.180 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:58.351
-And you -- The nice thing about
this film is Hailee Steinfeld,

00:01:58.351 --> 00:01:59.385 line:92%
who's a fantastic actress.

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:02.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She is.
-She is the hero of this film.

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:06.326
-Which I love, because if this
film, which takes place in 1987,

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:10.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
were to be filmed in 1987,
I would be the hero,

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she would be,
like, the love interest.

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:12.565 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:14.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But, damn it,
we're in a culture nowadays

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:15.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
where she can
actually be the hero

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:17.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
and kick some ass,
and I can be the bad guy.

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:20.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:22.876 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And you --

00:02:22.876 --> 00:02:26.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Take that, Mets fan.
I see you over there.

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, take that.
-Take that!

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:28.314 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:29.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm even wearing
the Mets' colors.

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:30.250 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
This is a shame.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, this is --
You did not play this well.

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:32.886 line:92%
-I am covered in shame syrup.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:36.089 size:78% position:39%
-You know, you relish
playing the bad guy,

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:37.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
which I think are
the fun bad guys to watch.

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:38.424 size:78% position:39%
-I don't re-- I mean,
I don't relish it.

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, I think you
find the fun in it.

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:42.028 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you come from
a world, wrestling,

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:43.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
where there's
the hero and the heel,

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.665
and people take that very
seriously in wrestling.

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:47.100 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think, you know,
it's not just you have

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
the wrestlers you root for,
you have wrestlers

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:49.869 line:92%
you actively root against.

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:54.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. And it's weird with me,
because I am supposed to be

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:56.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
the hero,
but I'm actually the heel.

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:56.843 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:58.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, and everybody is like,
"Man, why don't you just

00:02:58.545 --> 00:03:01.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
turn bad so you can
be cool again?"

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:03.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wait. Wouldn't that
make me good?

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:05.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I don't even know!

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:06.052 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And it's fun to, like,

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:07.987 align:start size:94% position:6%
go into the WWE warp zone
with those folks.

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:10.857
They think I'm supposed to be
a bad guy to be a good guy,

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:13.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
but aren't I already
being a bad guy?

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:14.427 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Just wait.

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:21.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just wait until
the debut of The CFO.

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:22.468 line:92%
Give me those TPS reports!

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:26.339 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow! That is really --
This has legs.

00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:28.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think it does not.
-It does.

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:29.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
You just have to
wear that into the ring.

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:31.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's going to be
very uncomfortable.

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:32.946 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes it will.

